WEBVTT

00:09.830 --> 00:12.500
Father... Father!

00:14.040 --> 00:15.250
Father!

00:15.920 --> 00:18.130
You must evacuate to the shelter, Selia.

00:19.380 --> 00:21.380
But why can't I go with YOU?!

00:23.580 --> 00:25.420
You have to go with Regina and the others.

00:26.040 --> 00:27.790
William will take you there.

00:28.210 --> 00:33.250
Then come with us! You and Mother, Eudice and Diana...

00:33.250 --> 00:35.130
We have to go fight.

00:35.670 --> 00:38.000
You haven't forgotten what I taught you, have you?

00:40.000 --> 00:43.080
To protect all the people who live in this city...

00:43.380 --> 00:47.420
That's right. We must stand tall
and fight to protect the people.

00:47.960 --> 00:50.880
Such is the duty entrusted to us as House Crystalia.

00:51.380 --> 00:53.330
So let me fight, too!

00:53.580 --> 00:57.830
Once you've awoken to your Holy Sword.
Then we can fight together.

00:58.830 --> 01:00.420
Come along, it's time.

01:05.500 --> 01:08.710
Selia, do you remember the fairy tale
about the Demon Lord?

01:10.420 --> 01:12.210
The story about the evil Demon Lord?

01:12.210 --> 01:15.960
Yes. I think there might be some truth to it.

01:16.380 --> 01:23.040
And yes, he IS evil... But he'll appear in our world
when we need him most to defeat the Voids for us.

03:06.290 --> 03:09.460
Level 3 sorcery capable of bringing a giant to its knees...

03:07.130 --> 03:09.330
<b>THE GODDESS' VOICE</b>

03:10.830 --> 03:13.380
Perhaps I went a bit overboard for a measly human.

03:23.830 --> 03:26.210
What the...? Who summoned these undead?

03:28.880 --> 03:30.830
Seems we made it just in time.

03:31.420 --> 03:34.790
You were knocked unconscious by the shockwave
but are otherwise uninjured.

03:35.040 --> 03:37.000
We shall protect you.

03:37.380 --> 03:38.290
Huh...?

03:39.630 --> 03:42.710
Color me shocked. I thought you were a normal human...

03:44.250 --> 03:46.170
...yet you can invoke undead soldiers.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.710
Level 6 sorcery...

03:49.210 --> 03:53.210
What do you say we put
your defensive abilities to the test?

03:53.460 --> 03:54.330
Miss Selia!

03:54.750 --> 03:55.420
Leo?!

04:00.580 --> 04:01.380
Are you alright?

04:01.790 --> 04:03.080
Y-yeah...

04:04.380 --> 04:08.130
So much for discretion.
I completely forgot to tone it down...

04:08.130 --> 04:09.710
Um, Leo?

04:10.420 --> 04:11.790
Who are those skeletons?

04:12.880 --> 04:16.380
They're the good luck charm I gave you earlier,
along with the True Ancestor Dress.

04:16.380 --> 04:18.710
Huh? You mean those keychains?

04:18.960 --> 04:21.500
Special amulets used to summon them.

04:21.750 --> 04:23.290
Ah, we haven't introduced ourselves.

04:23.540 --> 04:26.290
I am Amilas, Swordsman of the Ninth Circle.

04:25.170 --> 04:26.670
<b>SWORDSMAN OF THE NINTH CIRCLE</b>

04:25.170 --> 04:26.670
<b>AMILAS</b>

04:26.830 --> 04:29.790
I am Dorug, Champion of the Inferno!

04:28.420 --> 04:30.000
<b>CHAMPION OF THE INFERNO</b>

04:28.420 --> 04:30.000
<b>DORUG</b>

04:30.000 --> 04:33.170
And I am Nefisgal, Wizard of the Spirit World.

04:32.000 --> 04:33.460
<b>WIZARD OF THE SPIRIT WORLD</b>

04:32.000 --> 04:33.460
<b>NEFISGAL</b>

04:35.710 --> 04:39.000
We are the heroic Three Warriors of Rognas!

04:37.420 --> 04:39.080
<b>THREE WARRIORS OF ROGNAS</b>

04:39.330 --> 04:44.630
Please rest easy, milord. I have done my duty
and kept the young lady safe from harm.

04:44.630 --> 04:47.420
I was the first one to lay his life on the line!

04:47.420 --> 04:52.420
'Twas I who conjured an icy wind
to quell the heat of the flames, was it not?!

04:52.580 --> 04:55.540
Th-they're a lively bunch, aren't they?

04:57.330 --> 04:58.790
Do not humiliate me in front of-

05:06.000 --> 05:07.920
That was quite the intense spell.

05:09.330 --> 05:12.460
Had I been an ordinary human,
it would have reduced me to ash.

05:13.500 --> 05:16.960
How can this be? What's HE doing here...?

05:17.250 --> 05:18.580
Are you surprised?

05:19.170 --> 05:22.960
An attack like that isn't nearly strong enough to kill me.

05:32.210 --> 05:32.790
Wha-?!

05:34.670 --> 05:36.790
How the hell did he overpower my flames...?!

05:38.750 --> 05:39.750
Who are you?

05:39.750 --> 05:42.130
No, you're going to answer MY questions first.

05:43.710 --> 05:45.250
What exactly are you after-

05:54.380 --> 05:55.500
You think this is funny?

05:56.000 --> 06:02.880
Well, who wouldn't be in good spirits? Saint Tearis
has played her role in all this and devoured the offerings.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.380
Tearis...? What are you talking about?

06:05.460 --> 06:07.540
The saint is the Goddess' vessel.

06:07.960 --> 06:11.000
As for the Almighty Goddess, she's come back to life.

06:11.380 --> 06:12.290
Did you say "Goddess"?!

06:13.630 --> 06:16.040
Which means my services are no longer required.

06:16.710 --> 06:19.460
So no matter how much you squirm and struggle...

06:19.540 --> 06:20.250
Hold it!

06:24.000 --> 06:27.750
...this world is destined to crumble
at the hands of the Goddess.

06:34.460 --> 06:36.040
What was that guy's problem?

06:36.420 --> 06:38.250
And who's this "goddess"?

06:38.630 --> 06:39.670
I'm not sure...

06:40.210 --> 06:46.960
I remember seeing him a millennium ago. Nefakess
Reizaad. A retainer to Azra-Ael, Lord of the Underworld.

06:47.420 --> 06:49.580
He attended the Assembly
of the Eight Demon Lords many times.

06:50.080 --> 06:54.500
But why was he HERE...?
And the goddess he spoke of...

06:55.130 --> 06:58.210
Could it really be Roselia...?

07:05.380 --> 07:07.210
The symbol of the Sacred Order...

07:08.000 --> 07:10.880
A testament to the past,
when mankind revered the gods...

07:11.790 --> 07:13.540
It has strong ties to Tearis, too...

07:14.540 --> 07:16.750
Master, we must flee from this building.

07:17.170 --> 07:18.790
Make haste, Mistress!

07:23.130 --> 07:24.540
Leo, look...!

07:34.170 --> 07:36.330
That's the Void Lord I mentioned earlier.

07:37.170 --> 07:39.000
Milady, please get to safety.

07:50.420 --> 07:53.670
There's no doubt about it...
The Hymn of the Sacred Order.

07:54.290 --> 07:55.630
And THAT...

07:59.960 --> 08:05.000
...is what remains of the very same woman:
Saint Tearis Ressurrectia, one of the Six Heroes.

08:06.920 --> 08:10.420
Numerous Voids and a Void Lord-like creature
have appeared at the heart of the city!

08:10.880 --> 08:11.830
Are you serious?!

08:11.920 --> 08:13.250
Selia, come in!

08:13.920 --> 08:15.670
Selia? Selia!

08:17.210 --> 08:18.500
Huh? What's this for?

08:19.420 --> 08:20.920
Keep yourself hidden back here.

08:22.790 --> 08:23.750
Wait-!

09:03.290 --> 09:04.580
Holy Sword, activate!

09:14.500 --> 09:16.670
I've requested backup and advised evacuation.

09:17.330 --> 09:19.830
There should be enough time
to clear the Seventh Assault Garden.

09:20.210 --> 09:23.880
But given the circumstances,
retreating and flying back home isn't an option.

09:24.250 --> 09:25.960
Defeating the Void Lord is our only choice.

09:26.500 --> 09:28.420
Let's rendezvous with Lady Selia and the kid.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.540
First, we'll need transportation.

09:30.790 --> 09:34.420
I can track down a vehicle using my drones,
so you two will have to hold them off until then.

09:37.210 --> 09:38.290
Roger that!

09:38.540 --> 09:39.380
Understood!

09:44.880 --> 09:48.380
I can feel it. The goddess has returned...

10:17.380 --> 10:18.380
Curious...

10:18.710 --> 10:21.000
Any idea how to counter that?

10:21.380 --> 10:23.080
BLAST 'EM!

10:27.380 --> 10:28.460
Tsk...

10:34.540 --> 10:36.460
Hey, what the heck's going on?!

10:36.580 --> 10:37.830
Hang tight... I'll run a scan!

10:41.170 --> 10:41.960
Flanis!

10:46.420 --> 10:49.670
Try smashing their heads in!
If you do, they can't regenerate!

10:49.750 --> 10:50.580
Got it!

10:51.880 --> 10:54.250
Analysis complete! Its head is its weak spot!

10:54.750 --> 10:55.630
Much appreciated!

10:58.710 --> 11:01.170
Tearis was endowed with the power to restore life.

11:01.960 --> 11:05.000
Even now that she's a Void,
she likely possesses a similar ability.

11:09.420 --> 11:11.170
I shan't be outdone by the young lady!

11:11.540 --> 11:15.540
We ought to take a page... from the master's book!

11:17.330 --> 11:19.500
You don't have to tell me twice!

11:23.540 --> 11:27.750
Thank goodness for your poise
and unerring leadership, milord!

11:28.830 --> 11:29.880
Is it coming this way?!

11:31.330 --> 11:35.380
We have to kill it regardless,
so... I guess that saves us the trouble.

11:44.920 --> 11:46.170
I've located vehicles!

11:48.750 --> 11:51.210
I'll need to disable the authentication lock.
Cover me, okay?

12:11.540 --> 12:17.130
We've got our work cut out for us, but this is where
all that time spent on the battlefield pays off!

12:17.250 --> 12:20.540
Now let us show you just how fearsome we can be!

12:29.290 --> 12:30.380
Damn you, Tearis!

12:39.290 --> 12:42.210
If this is the extent of her strength,
we can fend her off. But...

12:43.080 --> 12:44.170
...there's no end in sight.

12:44.920 --> 12:45.960
Perhaps I should remedy that.

12:47.460 --> 12:50.040
Ashes to ashes, dust to dust...

12:50.710 --> 12:52.750
Ye who bear a grudge against me...

12:53.880 --> 12:55.960
Ye who would stand in my way...

12:56.380 --> 12:59.920
Embrace thy ruinous fate... Arzam.

13:11.000 --> 13:12.460
Whoa...

13:34.130 --> 13:35.080
No way!

13:46.750 --> 13:49.130
She managed to endure a Level 10 spell?

13:49.500 --> 13:51.130
She's more stubborn than I thought...

13:53.710 --> 13:54.170
Not good!

14:05.920 --> 14:06.460
Huh...?

14:07.130 --> 14:09.290
Huh?! Wait, what?!

14:44.790 --> 14:49.670
That's a Level 11 spell that causes
widespread destruction: Io Nemesis.

14:50.790 --> 14:51.830
Vile monster...

14:55.710 --> 14:58.380
Wh-what's happening out there...?

15:00.500 --> 15:02.790
Let's just... focus on the task at hand.

15:03.380 --> 15:03.960
Right.

15:13.540 --> 15:16.670
Miss Selia, I need you to protect me for a minute.

15:17.380 --> 15:18.710
I'm going to finish it off.

15:21.130 --> 15:22.960
'Kay, I'm on it.

15:23.210 --> 15:24.830
We shall assist, Mistress!

16:16.580 --> 16:19.790
O, wretched hero of humanity, blighted by nothingness...

16:23.670 --> 16:27.830
With this Demon Sword,
I shall grant you eternal devastation.

16:30.880 --> 16:36.000
Thy name, fallen to Darkness, is...
the Demon Sword, Dáinsleif!

16:40.250 --> 16:42.960
Now let the Six Heroes perish!

16:45.040 --> 16:45.750
What-?!

16:48.710 --> 16:50.040
It's resonating?!

16:50.670 --> 16:51.830
Your Demon Sword...

16:56.670 --> 16:59.040
Do you intend to kill me with it?

16:59.960 --> 17:02.790
That's... Roselia's voice...

17:05.420 --> 17:07.330
I'm afraid that isn't possible.

17:08.210 --> 17:11.880
Roselia's voice, coming from a Void Lord...?

17:12.330 --> 17:16.080
It can't be... There must be some mistake!

17:13.250 --> 17:15.290
You can't kill me with that sword.

17:17.580 --> 17:19.630
NOOOOO!

17:55.290 --> 17:56.290
Leo!

18:16.210 --> 18:17.210
Don't you dare!

18:46.540 --> 18:48.580
We must protect our master!

19:19.380 --> 19:22.210
If that really does happen...

19:23.750 --> 19:27.630
If that really does happen... I will track you down.

19:28.710 --> 19:33.460
Even if it means searching every hidden corner
of the world, I won't rest until I find you.

19:34.330 --> 19:35.710
You're awfully confident.

19:36.500 --> 19:40.080
Of course. A Demon Lord doesn't go back on his word.

19:43.080 --> 19:45.540
Miss Selia...

19:47.420 --> 19:48.290
Run away...

19:50.880 --> 19:52.420
Anyone but her...

19:53.330 --> 19:56.080
It's my fault she became my minion...

19:56.080 --> 19:59.080
She has to survive, no matter what...

20:00.830 --> 20:04.000
Oh, right... Go ahead and replenish your mana.

20:04.500 --> 20:06.580
You'll need it to escape with your life...

20:07.830 --> 20:11.080
Take all that's left. The last of my blood...

20:19.420 --> 20:22.670
Then I'd like you to promise me one more thing.

20:26.460 --> 20:31.460
In the distant future, if I end up
turning into something else entirely,

20:32.040 --> 20:35.330
I want you to kill me with your Demon Sword.

20:41.000 --> 20:43.540
"If I end up turning into something else..."

20:44.830 --> 20:48.210
Does this mean Roselia's been corrupted by Voids?

20:49.080 --> 20:54.210
And if it does, then... why have I been
brought back after a thousand years?

20:55.130 --> 21:00.250
If Roselia isn't herself anymore,
there's no point in me being here...

21:01.130 --> 21:02.750
Kill you...?

21:02.960 --> 21:05.290
No! Of course I'm not going to do that!

21:05.710 --> 21:07.170
Even if it's what I want?

21:07.580 --> 21:08.920
Not a chance!

21:10.170 --> 21:13.170
Fine. Forget I brought it up.

21:13.710 --> 21:17.000
But... when the time comes, you must remember.

21:17.920 --> 21:20.500
My request, your duty...

21:21.130 --> 21:24.750
And... remember to find the REAL me.

21:26.630 --> 21:31.790
I have no doubt that the Demon Sword I gave you
will guide you to your fate.

21:34.830 --> 21:37.290
It wasn't a dream...

21:38.170 --> 21:43.880
It was a memory of mine... that Roselia sealed away...

23:17.170 --> 23:17.710
We are!

23:18.750 --> 23:19.540
The heroic!

23:20.250 --> 23:21.250
Three Warriors of Rognas!

23:22.080 --> 23:22.630
We are!

23:22.630 --> 23:23.210
The heroic!

23:23.210 --> 23:24.330
Three Warriors of Rognas!

23:24.960 --> 23:28.000
Forget about "We are" and "The heroic."
Aim for "Three Warriors of Rognas."

23:28.500 --> 23:30.040
You'll have more time 'cause it's the longest.

23:30.670 --> 23:31.670
Good thinking.

23:32.210 --> 23:32.790
We are!

23:32.790 --> 23:33.670
The heroic!

23:34.040 --> 23:34.540
Bones!

23:34.540 --> 23:35.250
No fair!

23:47.080 --> 23:51.000
<b>THE TRUTH BEHIND THE DEMON SWORD</b>
